{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Third plan-review remediation for blocking T8 finding: enumerated both false generator assertions and their exact replacements. The Plan now changes the heading to `Exposure (CLI exposure)`, removes the `MCP config-transparency surface` clause, and makes the focused guard reject `MCP/CLI exposure`, `MCP config-transparency surface`, and `MCP configuration surface`. It also names the existing generator `--check` drift proof. Scope remains behavior-neutral with no MCP tool."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787419599801008001,"uuid":"5c213ce9-dab7-46c0-9321-a5e40e8befc2"}